        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Business Automation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">Streamline your business processes with custom automation solutions and workflow optimization tools.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-2 mb-6 text-left">
          <li>• Workflow automation</li>
          <li>• API integrations</li>
          <li>• Data processing pipelines</li>
          <li>• Custom automation tools</li>
          <li>• Process optimization</li>
        </ul>
